# A real Flash game's sound reaches the speaker: Orisinal's Winterbells, tapped into from its intro (T-614: the owner's
# "Flash games silent"; the audio policy held the plugin's stream at 0 % until the daemon raised it)
id: flash-game-sound
section: Media and sound
item: A Flash game's sound is audible: Winterbells tapped into, its stream above 0 % and the speaker amp on
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://www.ferryhalim.com/orisinal/g3/bells.htm
needs: internet
kit: cavekit-flash.md R9
wait rect 'sel:embed' 40
# a tap on the movie goes to the plugin, so no clickAt comes back: dismiss is the raw tap (the embed's centre)
dismiss 384 295
pause 4000
dismiss 384 295
pause 4000
dismiss 384 295
expect audio audible 20
shoot game
